{"0": "Annual revenue fell 12.7% from 1,744 hundred million won in 2022 to 1,522 hundred million won in 2023, then rose for two consecutive years: 1,551 hundred million won in 2024 (up 1.9% year on year) and 1,597 hundred million won in 2025 (up 3.0% year on year). Over 2022–2025, revenue was highest in 2022 and lowest in 2023. Operating profit dropped 57.5% from 111 hundred million won in 2022 to 47.1 hundred million won in 2023, hit its lowest point at 33.5 hundred million won in 2024 (down 28.8% year on year), and then recovered to 39.1 hundred million won in 2025 (up 16.7% year on year). The operating margin stayed low at 6.4% in 2022, 3.1% in 2023, 2.2% in 2024, and 2.4% in 2025. In other words, revenue has grown, but the margin has not returned to its 2022 level. Net income attributable to controlling shareholders moved from 91.4 hundred million won in 2022 to 16.2 hundred million won in 2023 (down 82.3%), 25.3 hundred million won in 2024 (up 55.8%), and 7.9 hundred million won in 2025 (down 68.9%). Net income for 2025 was 4.8 hundred million won, lower than the net income attributable to controlling shareholders, which implies that a loss was allocated to the non-controlling interests' share. Cash flow from operating activities declined from 122 hundred million won in 2022 to 21.6 hundred million won in 2024, then recovered to 107 hundred million won in 2025. The debt ratio fell from 63.8% in 2022 to 57.1% in 2025, and at the end of 2025 total equity was 1,030 hundred million won and total liabilities were 588 hundred million won. On a quarterly basis, fourth-quarter 2025 revenue of 479 hundred million won and operating profit of 31.5 hundred million won are the highest operating profit in the period reviewed. Operating profit fell to 12.3 hundred million won in the first quarter of 2026, then rose for two consecutive quarters to 20.4 hundred million won in the second quarter and 21.9 hundred million won in the third quarter. However, in the third quarter of 2026 the company swung to a net loss attributable to controlling shareholders of 14.1 hundred million won, and the sum of net income attributable to controlling shareholders over the most recent four quarters is 51.2 hundred million won. No specific one-off factors were identified in the body of the disclosure."}
===JSON_END===

